// The app's bundle identifier, kept out of the public project file.
//
// A free (Personal Team) registration of an identifier lapses about a week after
// the last build, and then any team may claim it. com.dhruvpatel.jarvis was in this
// public repo and was claimed by another team (2026-09-23), so Xcode could no
// longer sign the app at all. Put your own identifier in the git-ignored
// Signing.local.xcconfig next to this file:
//
//     JARVIS_BUNDLE_ID = com.yourname.jarvis
//
// Changing it makes macOS treat the app as new: Accessibility, Screen Recording and
// Microphone must be granted again, and Keychain "Always" rules start empty.
JARVIS_BUNDLE_ID = com.example.jarvis
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
